{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"questions\":[{\"id\":\"fe8417b4-969b-4568-beee-d6f260aa83a0\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Which pair of Indian products had a large market in Europe according to NCERT?\",\"hi\":\"NCERT के अनुसार भारतीय उत्पादों की किस जोड़ी का यूरोप में बड़ा बाजार था?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Coal and iron\",\"hi\":\"कोयला और लोहा\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Cotton and silk\",\"hi\":\"कपास और रेशम\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Tea and coffee\",\"hi\":\"चाय और कॉफी\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Wool and tobacco\",\"hi\":\"ऊन और तंबाकू\"}},\"difficulty\":\"basic\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-19: National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT) — https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/hess202.pdf#page=2 — Printed page 10, PDF page 2: Charter of 1600, English monopoly, European competitors and goods in demand\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Our Pasts–III, Class VIII, Chapter 2: From Trade to Territory\",\"institution\":\"National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT)\",\"url\":\"https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/hess202.pdf#page=2\",\"citation\":\"Printed page 10, PDF page 2: Charter of 1600, English monopoly, European competitors and goods in demand\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Printed page 10, PDF page 2: Charter of 1600, English monopoly, European competitors and goods in demand\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"RAILWAY\",\"STATE_ONEDAY\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"fe79d4c8-390a-4009-86d2-06f881fe1f0d\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Who granted the Diwani of Bengal, Bihar and Orissa to the East India Company?\",\"hi\":\"ईस्ट इंडिया कंपनी को बंगाल, बिहार और उड़ीसा की दीवानी किसने प्रदान की थी?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Mir Jafar\",\"hi\":\"मीर जाफर\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Shah Alam II\",\"hi\":\"शाह आलम द्वितीय\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Shuja-ud-Daulah\",\"hi\":\"शुजाउद्दौला\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Sirajuddaulah\",\"hi\":